### Turn 1 — Invoke the agent
# @name chatStart
POST http://localhost:8088/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "What is the future of artificial intelligence in two sentences?",
  "stream": false
}

### Capture previous_response_id from the response of Turn 1
@previous_response_id={{chatStart.response.body.$.id}}

### Turn 2 — Follow up using the response ID from Turn 1
POST http://localhost:8088/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "Can you summarize that in one sentence?",
  "previous_response_id": "{{previous_response_id}}",
  "stream": false
}